prayerTemplate:
PRAYER

In the light of the facts and circumstances stated above, the Plaintiff most respectfully prays that this Hon'ble Court may graciously be pleased to:

a) Pass a decree for the sum of Rs. {total_suit_amount}/- (Rupees ________ only) in favour of the Plaintiff and against the Defendant, comprising Rs. {principal_amount}/- as principal and Rs. {interest_amount}/- as interest accrued up to the date of suit;

b) Grant pendente lite and future interest at the rate of 12% per annum (or such rate as this Hon'ble Court deems just) from the date of suit till realisation, under Section 34 CPC;

c) Award costs of the suit in favour of the Plaintiff;

d) Pass any other order(s) as this Hon'ble Court may deem fit and proper in the interest of justice.

And for this act of kindness, the Plaintiff shall ever pray.
